# The temporary file the merge writes before renaming it into place, and the
# copy --backup keeps of a replaced output. SPEC 18.2 leaves those names to the
# implementation, so keep these in step with temporary_path_for() and
# backup_existing() in src/pkgmerge/merge.cpp.
*.pkgmerge-tmp
*.pkgmerge-bak
*-merged.pkg

